Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 22:25:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Pinch zoom through Free Look's field of view

Adds NativeLibrary.SetCameraZoom(), which the gesture controls use for
pinch zoom. It narrows Free Look's field of view
(CameraControllerInput::SetFovMultiplier). Only perspective projections
change, so the games' 2D menus and text stay as they are. Free Look is
only turned on (in the CurrentRun layer) while the camera is zoomed.
---
 .../org/dolphinemu/dolphinemu/NativeLibrary.kt   |  7 +++++++
 Source/Android/jni/MainAndroid.cpp               | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 Source/Core/VideoCommon/FreeLookCamera.cpp       |  7 +++++++
 Source/Core/VideoCommon/FreeLookCamera.h         |  2 ++
 4 files changed, 32 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Source/Android/app/src/main/java/org/dolphinemu/dolphinemu/NativeLibrary.kt b/Source/Android/app/src/main/java/org/dolphinemu/dolphinemu/NativeLibrary.kt
index 6b2bbea..c628a20 100644
--- a/Source/Android/app/src/main/java/org/dolphinemu/dolphinemu/NativeLibrary.kt
